

Teksto kon: ['html'] buhata: { <- (
		kaugalingon
		ilisi: ['&'] ug: ['&amp;'],
		ilisi: ['<'] ug: ['&lt;'],
		ilisi: ['>'] ug: ['&gt;'],
		ilisi: ['"'] ug: ['&quot;']
	).
}.


Gawas isulat: ([' left trimmed '] putli) + [' '] + ( ['and right trimmed'] putli) + ['!'], bag-ong-linya.
Gawas isulat: ['<html>"html & entities"</html>'] html.
